# Vercel uploads (CLI) and builds (Git) only what the showcase build needs: the workspaces, the
# lockfile, the asset guard and its policy helper. See docs/showcase.md#deployment.
/*
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/vercel.json
!/packages
!/examples
!/scripts
/scripts/*
!/scripts/check-showcase-assets.mjs
!/scripts/release-policy.mjs
node_modules
dist
